{"seq":3,"slug":"eventual-consistency","title":"最终一致性保障机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/eventual-consistency","wordCount":1574,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"最终一致性保障机制\">最终一致性保障机制</h1><p>在事件驱动的微服务系统中，强一致性（Strong Consistency）往往无法保证——服务独立部署、网络可能分区、消息可能重复投递。系统设计者需要接受<strong>最终一致性</strong>作为默认状态，并围绕它建立可靠的保障机制。本文从 BASE 模型出发，系统介绍幂等消费、去重策略和补偿事务等核心技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>最终一致性</strong></td>\n<td>在无新输入的情况下，系统最终达到一致状态</td>\n<td>允许暂时不一致窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>幂等操作</strong></td>\n<td>执行多次与执行一次效果相同（f(f(x))=f(x)）</td>\n<td>安全处理重复消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>At-least-once</strong></td>\n<td>消息至少投递一次，可能重复</td>\n<td>Kafka 默认语义，需配合幂等消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Exactly-once</strong></td>\n<td>消息恰好投递一次</td>\n<td>Kafka EOS：幂等生产者+事务 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Outbox 模式</strong></td>\n<td>业务操作和事件写入放在同一数据库事务中</td>\n<td>解决事件发布与业务操作的原子性问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>补偿事务</strong></td>\n<td>语义逆操作，撤销已提交的分布式操作</td>\n<td>与 Saga 模式配合使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"base-模型与最终一致性\">BASE 模型与最终一致性</h2><p>传统 ACID 事务（原子性、一致性、隔离性、持久性）在分布式场景代价极高。BASE 模型提供了现实可行的替代方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>ACID</th>\n<th>BASE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>强一致（随时一致）</td>\n<td>最终一致（允许暂时不一致）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可用性</td>\n<td>优先一致性</td>\n<td>优先可用性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隔离</td>\n<td>完全隔离</td>\n<td>近似隔离（允许脏读场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>银行转账</td>\n<td>电商库存、社交点赞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>BASE 的三个特性：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Basically Available（基本可用）</strong>：系统在故障时仍然可以响应，但可能降级</li>\n<li><strong>Soft State（软状态）</strong>：系统状态可能随时间变化，即使没有外部输入</li>\n<li><strong>Eventually Consistent（最终一致）</strong>：在没有新输入的情况下，系统最终达到一致状态</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Order Service&lt;br/&gt;订单已创建] --&gt;|发布事件| B[Message Queue]&#10;    B --&gt;|异步消费| C[Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;库存待扣减]&#10;    B --&gt;|异步消费| D[Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;支付待处理]&#10;    C --&gt;|处理完成| E[最终一致状态]&#10;    D --&gt;|处理完成| E\">graph LR\n    A[Order Service&lt;br/&gt;订单已创建] --&gt;|发布事件| B[Message Queue]\n    B --&gt;|异步消费| C[Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;库存待扣减]\n    B --&gt;|异步消费| D[Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;支付待处理]\n    C --&gt;|处理完成| E[最终一致状态]\n    D --&gt;|处理完成| E</pre><p>在事件发布后、消费者处理完成前，系统处于<strong>暂时不一致</strong>状态。设计者需要明确每个业务场景能容忍的不一致窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等消费-idempotent-consumer\">幂等消费（Idempotent Consumer）</h2><p>消息系统只能保证&quot;至少一次投递&quot;（At-least-once），不能保证&quot;恰好一次&quot;（Exactly-once），这意味着消费者必须处理重复消息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"什么是幂等性\">什么是幂等性</h3><p><strong>幂等操作</strong>：执行多次与执行一次产生相同效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"f(f(x)) = f(x)&#10;&#10;# 幂等的例子：&#10;SET user_status = &#39;active&#39;  -- 执行多次效果相同&#10;&#10;# 非幂等的例子：&#10;INSERT INTO orders VALUES (...)  -- 执行多次会重复插入&#10;account.balance -= 100          -- 执行多次会重复扣款\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>f(f(x)) = f(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 幂等的例子：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SET user_status = 'active'  -- 执行多次效果相同</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 非幂等的例子：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>INSERT INTO orders VALUES (...)  -- 执行多次会重复插入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>account.balance -= 100          -- 执行多次会重复扣款</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"幂等消费实现策略\">幂等消费实现策略</h3><p><strong>策略一：事件 ID 去重表</strong></p>\n<p>最通用的去重方案：在消费端维护已处理事件 ID 的记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 去重表结构&#10;CREATE TABLE processed_events (&#10;    event_id     VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    event_type   VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;    processed_at TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    INDEX idx_processed_at (processed_at)  -- 便于清理过期记录&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 去重表结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processed_events</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    processed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_processed_at (processed_at)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 便于清理过期记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Transactional&#10;public void processOrderPlacedEvent(OrderPlacedEvent event) {&#10;    // 检查是否已处理&#10;    if (processedEventRepository.existsById(event.getId())) {&#10;        log.info(&quot;Event {} already processed, skipping&quot;, event.getId());&#10;        return;  // 幂等：跳过重复消息&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 处理业务逻辑&#10;    inventoryService.reserveItems(event.getItems());&#10;&#10;    // 记录已处理（与业务逻辑在同一事务中）&#10;    processedEventRepository.save(new ProcessedEvent(event.getId(), event.getType()));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Transactional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processOrderPlacedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(OrderPlacedEvent event) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查是否已处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (processedEventRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">existsById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Event {} already processed, skipping\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等：跳过重复消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 处理业务逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inventoryService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reserveItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 记录已处理（与业务逻辑在同一事务中）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    processedEventRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProcessedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), event.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键点：<strong>去重记录的插入必须与业务逻辑在同一事务中</strong>，否则在业务成功但去重记录未写入时崩溃，下次重试仍会重复处理。</p>\n<p><strong>策略二：乐观锁版本控制</strong></p>\n<p>对于状态机类的操作，使用版本号防重：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@Transactional&#10;public void processPaymentCompleted(String orderId, long eventVersion) {&#10;    Order order = orderRepository.findById(orderId)&#10;        .orElseThrow(() -&gt; new OrderNotFoundException(orderId));&#10;&#10;    // 检查版本号：只有当前版本匹配才处理&#10;    if (order.getVersion() != eventVersion - 1) {&#10;        log.warn(&quot;Stale event for order {}, expected version {}, got {}&quot;,&#10;                 orderId, order.getVersion() + 1, eventVersion);&#10;        return;  // 重复消息或乱序消息，跳过&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    order.markAsPaid();&#10;    order.setVersion(eventVersion);&#10;    orderRepository.save(order);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Transactional</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processPaymentCompleted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(String orderId, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventVersion) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Order order </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">orElseThrow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderNotFoundException</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(orderId));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查版本号：只有当前版本匹配才处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eventVersion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Stale event for order {}, expected version {}, got {}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                 orderId, order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, eventVersion);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 重复消息或乱序消息，跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markAsPaid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    order.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(eventVersion);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    orderRepository.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>策略三：天然幂等的操作</strong></p>\n<p>部分操作天然幂等，无需额外去重：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- UPDATE 基于业务键，而非自增 ID&#10;UPDATE inventory&#10;SET reserved_quantity = reserved_quantity + 2&#10;WHERE product_id = &#39;prod-001&#39;&#10;AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM inventory_reservations&#10;    WHERE order_id = &#39;order-12345&#39; AND product_id = &#39;prod-001&#39;&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- UPDATE 基于业务键，而非自增 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved_quantity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'prod-001'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_reservations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order-12345'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'prod-001'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消息投递语义\">消息投递语义</h2><h3 id=\"三种投递语义\">三种投递语义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>At-most-once</strong></td>\n<td>最多一次，可能丢失</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n<td>指标上报、非关键通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>At-least-once</strong></td>\n<td>至少一次，可能重复</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>配合幂等消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Exactly-once</strong></td>\n<td>恰好一次，不丢不重</td>\n<td>最复杂</td>\n<td>金融交易、库存扣减</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"kafka-的-exactly-once-语义-eos\">Kafka 的 Exactly-once 语义（EOS）</h3><p>Kafka 通过<strong>幂等生产者</strong>（Idempotent Producer）+ <strong>事务 API</strong> 实现生产端的 exactly-once：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"Properties props = new Properties();&#10;props.put(&quot;bootstrap.servers&quot;, &quot;kafka:9092&quot;);&#10;props.put(&quot;enable.idempotence&quot;, &quot;true&quot;);           // 幂等生产者&#10;props.put(&quot;transactional.id&quot;, &quot;order-service-txn&quot;); // 事务 ID（每个生产者实例唯一）&#10;props.put(&quot;acks&quot;, &quot;all&quot;);&#10;&#10;KafkaProducer&lt;String, String&gt; producer = new KafkaProducer&lt;&gt;(props);&#10;producer.initTransactions();&#10;&#10;try {&#10;    producer.beginTransaction();&#10;&#10;    // 发布多个相关事件在同一事务中&#10;    producer.send(new ProducerRecord&lt;&gt;(&quot;order-events&quot;, orderId, orderPlacedJson));&#10;    producer.send(new ProducerRecord&lt;&gt;(&quot;audit-events&quot;, orderId, auditLogJson));&#10;&#10;    producer.commitTransaction();&#10;} catch (ProducerFencedException | OutOfOrderSequenceException e) {&#10;    producer.close();  // 不可恢复，需重启生产者&#10;} catch (KafkaException e) {&#10;    producer.abortTransaction();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Properties props </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bootstrap.servers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kafka:9092\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enable.idempotence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等生产者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"transactional.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service-txn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 事务 ID（每个生产者实例唯一）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">props.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">KafkaProducer&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> producer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> KafkaProducer&#x3C;>(props);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">initTransactions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beginTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 发布多个相关事件在同一事务中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProducerRecord&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId, orderPlacedJson));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ProducerRecord&#x3C;>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"audit-events\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, orderId, auditLogJson));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">commitTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (ProducerFencedException | OutOfOrderSequenceException </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不可恢复，需重启生产者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (KafkaException </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    producer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abortTransaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：Kafka EOS 解决的是<strong>生产端</strong>的 exactly-once 问题（消息写入 Kafka 恰好一次）。端到端的 exactly-once（包含消费和处理）还需要消费端的幂等性保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"outbox-模式-保证事件发布可靠性\">Outbox 模式：保证事件发布可靠性</h2><p>一个常见的一致性问题：业务操作成功，但事件发布失败怎么办？</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 不安全的做法（两次独立操作，可能半成功）&#10;1. 更新数据库（成功）&#10;2. 发布事件到 Kafka（失败？）&#10;   → 数据库已更新，但其他服务永远不知道这件事\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 不安全的做法（两次独立操作，可能半成功）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. 更新数据库（成功）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 发布事件到 Kafka（失败？）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   → 数据库已更新，但其他服务永远不知道这件事</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Outbox 模式通过将事件写入与业务操作放入<strong>同一数据库事务</strong>来解决这个问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Service&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;    participant Relay as Outbox Relay&#10;    participant Kafka&#10;&#10;    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION&#10;    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE order SET status=&#39;placed&#39;&#10;    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO outbox (event_type, payload)&#10;    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: COMMIT&#10;&#10;    Relay-&gt;&gt;DB: 轮询 / Change Data Capture&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;Relay: 未发布的 outbox 记录&#10;    Relay-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布事件&#10;    Relay-&gt;&gt;DB: 标记 outbox 记录为已发布\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Service\n    participant DB as 数据库\n    participant Relay as Outbox Relay\n    participant Kafka\n\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE order SET status='placed'\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO outbox (event_type, payload)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: COMMIT\n\n    Relay-&gt;&gt;DB: 轮询 / Change Data Capture\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Relay: 未发布的 outbox 记录\n    Relay-&gt;&gt;Kafka: 发布事件\n    Relay-&gt;&gt;DB: 标记 outbox 记录为已发布</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- Outbox 表结构&#10;CREATE TABLE event_outbox (&#10;    id           BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    event_id     UUID         NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;    event_type   VARCHAR(128) NOT NULL,&#10;    aggregate_id VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;    payload      JSONB        NOT NULL,&#10;    created_at   TIMESTAMP    NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,&#10;    published_at TIMESTAMP    NULL  -- NULL 表示待发布&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 业务事务示例（PostgreSQL）&#10;BEGIN;&#10;UPDATE orders SET status = &#39;placed&#39; WHERE id = &#39;order-12345&#39;;&#10;INSERT INTO event_outbox (event_id, event_type, aggregate_id, payload)&#10;VALUES (&#10;    gen_random_uuid(),&#10;    &#39;order.placed&#39;,&#10;    &#39;order-12345&#39;,&#10;    &#39;{&quot;orderId&quot;: &quot;order-12345&quot;, &quot;customerId&quot;: &quot;cust-67890&quot;}&#39;::jsonb&#10;);&#10;COMMIT;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Outbox 表结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> event_outbox</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_id     UUID         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    payload      JSONB        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    published_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- NULL 表示待发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 业务事务示例（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'placed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'order-12345'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_outbox (event_id, event_type, aggregate_id, payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    gen_random_uuid(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'order.placed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'order-12345'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '{\"orderId\": \"order-12345\", \"customerId\": \"cust-67890\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::jsonb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">COMMIT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现 Outbox 中继（Relay）的方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>轮询</strong>：定期查询 <code>published_at IS NULL</code> 的记录并发布（实现简单，有轻微延迟）</li>\n<li><strong>Change Data Capture（CDC）</strong>：使用 Debezium 监听数据库 binlog 实时捕获变更（实时性高，基础设施复杂）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"补偿事务与-saga\">补偿事务与 Saga</h2><p>当分布式操作失败时，无法回滚已提交的其他服务的操作。此时需要<strong>补偿事务</strong>（Compensating Transaction）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"正向操作序列：&#10;  预留库存 → 扣款 → 创建配送单&#10;&#10;如果&quot;创建配送单&quot;失败，需要补偿：&#10;  取消配送单 → 退款 → 释放库存\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>正向操作序列：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  预留库存 → 扣款 → 创建配送单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>如果\"创建配送单\"失败，需要补偿：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  取消配送单 → 退款 → 释放库存</span></span></code></pre></div><p>补偿事务不是撤销，而是<strong>语义逆操作</strong>。它必须设计为幂等的，因为补偿本身也可能失败并需要重试。Saga 模式就是管理这种跨服务补偿逻辑的标准模式，在第3章实现模式中详细介绍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见陷阱与最佳实践\">常见陷阱与最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>避免方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未实现幂等消费</td>\n<td>重试导致重复扣款/重复发货</td>\n<td>使用事件 ID 去重表或乐观锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件发布与业务操作不原子</td>\n<td>数据库已更新但事件丢失</td>\n<td>使用 Outbox 模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补偿逻辑未实现</td>\n<td>部分失败导致数据不一致，无法恢复</td>\n<td>为每个正向操作设计补偿操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性窗口未明确</td>\n<td>下游读到&quot;旧&quot;状态，用户困惑</td>\n<td>明确并测量一致性窗口，设置合理超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖消息顺序</td>\n<td>消费者假设消息有序，实际 Kafka partition 可能乱序</td>\n<td>设计消费者为幂等且顺序无关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"兄弟文档参考\">兄弟文档参考</h2><p>本文介绍最终一致性的基础机制；Outbox 模式中的 Kafka 生产者配置细节，见第2章基础设施中的 Kafka 架构文档；Saga 编排（跨服务补偿逻辑的完整实现），见第3章实现模式的 Saga 文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>事件驱动系统的一致性保障建立在三个支柱上：<strong>幂等消费</strong>（用事件 ID 去重表或乐观锁处理重复消息）、<strong>Outbox 模式</strong>（用同一数据库事务保证事件发布的原子性）、<strong>补偿事务</strong>（为每个正向操作设计语义逆操作）。Kafka 的 Exactly-once 语义（幂等生产者 + 事务 API + <code>read_committed</code> 隔离级别）解决了生产端的重复写入问题，但端到端 exactly-once 仍需要消费端幂等性配合。明确每个业务场景能容忍的不一致窗口，是最终一致性系统设计的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"最终一致性保障机制","id":"最终一致性保障机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BASE 模型与最终一致性","id":"base-模型与最终一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等消费（Idempotent Consumer）","id":"幂等消费-idempotent-consumer"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是幂等性","id":"什么是幂等性"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等消费实现策略","id":"幂等消费实现策略"},{"level":2,"text":"消息投递语义","id":"消息投递语义"},{"level":3,"text":"三种投递语义","id":"三种投递语义"},{"level":3,"text":"Kafka 的 Exactly-once 语义（EOS）","id":"kafka-的-exactly-once-语义-eos"},{"level":2,"text":"Outbox 模式：保证事件发布可靠性","id":"outbox-模式-保证事件发布可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"补偿事务与 Saga","id":"补偿事务与-saga"},{"level":2,"text":"常见陷阱与最佳实践","id":"常见陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档参考","id":"兄弟文档参考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"消息契约设计模式：Schema 演化与兼容性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/foundations/message-contract-patterns"},"next":{"title":"Kafka 架构与运维实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-microservices/infrastructure/kafka-architecture"}}